<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Conditions & Support — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="How our cohort programs and educational resources support common concerns with a whole-person lens in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fffefc;--muted:#666;--accent:#2a7f62;--card:#fff;--accent-2:#f2b705;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffefc,#ffffff);color:#111}
    header{padding:14px 22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #f2f2f2}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:800}
    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{padding:22px;max-width:980px;margin:0 auto}
    h1{color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 6px}
    .lead{color:#333;margin:0 0 18px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(20,20,20,0.04)}
    .condition{margin-bottom:12px}
    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);background:#fff8e6;padding:10px;border-radius:8px}
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    footer{padding:22px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}
    @media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div class="logo">H</div>
      <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="services.html">Ways We Help</a>
      <a href="conditions.html" aria-current="page">Conditions</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Our Method</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <h1 data-reveal>Conditions we support</h1>
    <p class="lead" data-reveal>We offer cohort-based education, practical routines and community support for common concerns that benefit from lifestyle and behavioral approaches.</p>

    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:18px">
      <div>
        <div class="card" data-reveal>
          <div class="disclaimer" role="note">
            Important: Our cohorts and resources are educational. They do not replace medical diagnosis or individualized treatment. If you have a serious or life-threatening condition, contact emergency services or a licensed health professional. If you are under medical care, consult your clinician before changing medications or treatment plans.
          </div>

          <section style="margin-top:12px">
            <h2 class="reveal" data-reveal>Mild-to-moderate sleep disruption</h2>
            <div class="condition reveal" data-reveal>
              <p class="muted">What we focus on: sleep timing, evening habits, light exposure and short bedtime rituals that support consistent sleep without complex prescriptions.</p>
              <p class="muted">Educational approach: stepwise evening experiments and group troubleshooting, not medication management.</p>
            </div>

            <h2 class="reveal" data-reveal>Stress-related digestive symptoms</h2>
            <div class="condition reveal" data-reveal>
              <p class="muted">What we focus on: gentle dietary patterns, stress-moderation techniques and pacing strategies that can ease common GI complaints influenced by stress.</p>
              <p class="muted">Educational approach: real-world routines and pacing rather than one-size-fits-all diets. See a clinician if you have severe pain, blood in stools, or unexplained weight loss.</p>
            </div>

            <h2 class="reveal" data-reveal>Persistent low energy & overwhelm</h2>
            <div class="condition reveal" data-reveal>
              <p class="muted">What we focus on: small habit cycles—movement, rest windows, and priority-setting—so energy stabilizes across a week.</p>
              <p class="muted">Educational approach: cohort tools to test micro-changes and track effects. Not a replacement for assessment of medical causes of fatigue.</p>
            </div>

            <h2 class="reveal" data-reveal>Anxiety that interrupts routine</h2>
            <div class="condition reveal" data-reveal>
              <p class="muted">What we focus on: grounding exercises, short breath practices and behavioral experiments you can practice between sessions.</p>
              <p class="muted">Educational approach: supportive skill-building. If anxiety is severe or disabling, we will recommend clinical care and collaboration.</p>
            </div>

          </section>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="card" data-reveal>
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">How to choose support</h3>
        <ol style="padding-left:16px">
          <li class="muted">Identify one pattern you want to change (sleep, digestion, energy).</li>
          <li class="muted">Pick a short cohort that targets that domain.</li>
          <li class="muted">Use the group for accountability; bring medical questions to your clinician.</li>
        </ol>
        <div style="margin-top:12px"><a href="book.html" class="btn" style="padding:8px 12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">Find a cohort</a></div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px" class="muted">If you are under current medical treatment, discuss cohort participation with your provider. Our materials are educational and community-based.</div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:20px">
      <h2 data-reveal>Referral and safety</h2>
      <div class="card" data-reveal>
        <p class="muted">When a cohort participant needs more specialized care (e.g. severe psychiatric symptoms, complex gastrointestinal disease, or urgent medical issues), we will recommend appropriate referrals and provide supportive resources to coordinate care. Our facilitators will not alter prescribed medication regimens. If you are in crisis, call local emergency services or a crisis line.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="muted">Questions? Email: {{EMAIL}} · Phone: {{PHONE}}</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with reduced motion support (duplicate-safe)
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const nodes = document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]');
      if(prefersReduced){ nodes.forEach(n=>n.classList.add('visible')); return }
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
        entries.forEach(e=>{ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('visible'); io.unobserve(e.target) } });
      },{threshold:0.08});
      nodes.forEach(n=>io.observe(n));
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Our Method — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A cohort-based, practical framework for layering skills and supports. Educational and collaborative care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f7fbfb;--accent:#d45d79;--muted:#6a6a6a;--card:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto}
    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#111}
